{"id":16,"post_title":"Om oss","post_slug":"om-oss","taxonomies":[],"post_link":"http://solvesborgshem.se.preview72.i8t.com/om-oss/","yoast":{"title":"Om oss - Sölvesborgshem","desc":"","image":"","focus_keywords":"","meta_keywords":""},"heading":"Om oss","preamble":"Sölvesborgshem är Sölvesborgs största fastighetsbolag. Vi har knappt 1 250 lägenheter till uthyrning för privatpersoner, men vi hyr även ut fastigheter till den kommunala omsorgen och till företag. Våra lägenheter, som finns i och omkring Sölvesborg i västra Blekinge, finns främst i flerbostadshus, men vi har även marklägenheter och radhus.","modules":[{"acf_fc_layout":"shortcuts","heading":"Vad vill du veta mer om?","shortcuts":[{"id":110,"post_title":"Felanmälan via vår app","post_slug":"felanmalan-via-var-app","taxonomies":[],"image":{"ID":111,"id":111,"title":"genvag-app","filename":"genvag-app.jpg","filesize":43447,"url":"http://solvesborgshem.se.preview72.i8t.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/genvag-app.jpg","link":"http://solvesborgshem.se.preview72.i8t.com/shortcut/felanmalan-via-var-app/attachment/genvag-app/","alt":"Felanmälan via vår app","author":"1","description":"","caption":"","name":"genvag-app","status":"inherit","uploaded_to":110,"date":"2018-09-14 09:11:15","modified":"2018-09-14 09:11:29","menu_order":0,"mime_type":"image/jpeg","type":"image","subtype":"jpeg","icon":"http://solvesborgshem.se.preview72.i8t.com/wp-includes/images/media/default.png","width":240,"height":240,"sizes":{"thumbnail":"http://solvesborgshem.se.preview72.i8t.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/genvag-app-150x150.jpg","thumbnail-width":150,"thumbnail-height":150,"medium":"http://solvesborgshem.se.preview72.i8t.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/genvag-app.jpg","medium-width":240,"medium-height":240,"medium_large":"http://solvesborgshem.se.preview72.i8t.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/genvag-app.jpg","medium_large-width":240,"medium_large-height":240,"large":"http://solvesborgshem.se.preview72.i8t.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/